#: NAVIGATION.md:1
msgid ""
"Structural refinement of protein targets with Bayesian inference for "
"improved druggability"
msgstr "Druggability の改善に向けた、Bayesian Inference による標的タンパク質の構造 Refinement"

#: NAVIGATION.md:3
msgid "Aims"
msgstr "目的"

#: NAVIGATION.md:4
msgid ""
"The aim of this tutorial is to learn how to use Bayesian inference through "
"PLUMED to refine protein complexes for enhanced virtual screening of small "
"molecules, critical for advancing drug discovery."
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは、PLUMED を通じて Bayesian Inference を使い、タンパク質複合体を Refinement して Small"
" Molecules の Virtual Screening を改善する方法を学ぶ。これは創薬を進めるうえで重要である。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:6
msgid "Theoretical background"
msgstr "理論的背景"

#: NAVIGATION.md:7
msgid ""
"This tutorial uses the bAIes approach that is founded on the principles of "
"Bayesian inference. It combines the local strucural uncertainties in "
"AlphaFold (AF) predictions with state-of-the-art molecular mechanics force "
"fields to optimally improve the physico-chemical properties of the system. A"
" more detailed theory is described in the following publication:"
msgstr ""
"Bayesian Inference に基づく bAIes を使う。AlphaFold（AF）予測の局所的な構造の不確実性と、現在の Molecular"
" Mechanics Force Fields を統合し、系の物理化学的性質を最適に改善する。理論の詳細は次の論文にある。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:10
msgid ""
"[S. Sen, S. E. Hoff, T. Morozova, V. Schnapka, M. Bonomi. Advancing in "
"silico drug design with Bayesian refinement of AlphaFold "
"models.](https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.06.25.661454 )"
msgstr ""
"[S. Sen, S. E. Hoff, T. Morozova, V. Schnapka, M. Bonomi. Advancing in "
"silico drug design with Bayesian refinement of AlphaFold "
"models.](https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.06.25.661454 )"

#: NAVIGATION.md:13 NAVIGATION.md:47
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "インストール"

#: NAVIGATION.md:14
msgid ""
"Installation instructions of the software to perform bAIes simulations in "
"this tutorial can be found [here](install.md)."
msgstr "このチュートリアルの bAIes 計算に必要なソフトウェアの導入は、[こちら](install.md)にある。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:16
msgid "Resources"
msgstr "資料"

#: NAVIGATION.md:17
msgid ""
"To do this tutorial, we provide you with the scripts needed to generate the "
"PLUMED input files, and the protocol to build and refine a protein complex "
"system."
msgstr "PLUMED 入力を作るスクリプトと、タンパク質複合体の構築・Refinement の Protocol を提供する。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:19
msgid ""
"The files needed to complete the tutorial can be found in our github "
"repository. We suggest that you clone this repository to avail the required "
"files all at once at a location where you desire to do this tutorial. Access"
" the repository [here](https://github.com/COSBlab/bAIes-SM)."
msgstr ""
"必要なファイルは GitHub にある。作業する場所にリポジトリを clone "
"し、まとめて取得することを勧める。[こちら](https://github.com/COSBlab/bAIes-SM)からアクセスできる。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:22 NAVIGATION.md:46
msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "チュートリアル"

#: NAVIGATION.md:23
msgid ""
"For the purpose of this tutorial, we use the case of a human estrogen "
"receptor (PDB 3ERD). This system comprises the ligand-binding domain (LBD) "
"of the receptor (herα) in complex with diethylstilbestrol (DES) and a "
"peptide derived from the NR box II region of the coactivator GRIP1, as well "
"as the crystal structure of the hERα LBD bound to the selective antagonist "
"4-hydroxytamoxifen (OHT). We focus on the DES-LBD-peptide complex."
msgstr ""
"Human Estrogen Receptor（PDB 3ERD）を例に使う。この系には、Receptor（herα）の Ligand-binding "
"Domain（LBD）、Diethylstilbestrol（DES）、Coactivator GRIP1 の NR Box II 由来の "
"Peptide の複合体がある。また、Selective Antagonist の 4-Hydroxytamoxifen（OHT）と結合した hERα "
"LBD の結晶構造もある。ここでは DES-LBD-Peptide Complex に注目する。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:31
msgid ""
"<em>The entire protein complex and a close-up view of the binding pocket "
"showing the protein molecular bonds, with the native ligand inside it.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>タンパク質複合体の全体と Binding Pocket の拡大図。タンパク質の Bonds と、Pocket 内の Native Ligand "
"を示す。</em>"

#: NAVIGATION.md:34
msgid ""
"The tutorial starts from the protein sequence, and takes you through the "
"AlphaFold structure prediction, followed by Bayesian structural refinement "
"by bAIes. After this, an optimal model is selected as a refined docking "
"target from an ensemble of bAIes models."
msgstr ""
"タンパク質配列から始め、AlphaFold による構造予測、bAIes による Bayesian Structural Refinement "
"へ進む。得られたモデルの Ensemble から、Refinement した Docking Target として最適なモデルを選ぶ。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:37
msgid "Flowchart"
msgstr "フローチャート"

#: NAVIGATION.md:38
msgid ""
"The flow chart shown below indicates the order in which you should consult "
"the resources. You can click on the nodes to access the various resources. "
"Follow the thick black lines for the best results. The resources that are "
"connected by dashed lines are supplementary resources that you may find "
"useful during the exercise. (The tutorial can be accessed "
"[here](https://github.com/COSBlab/bAIes-SM/tree/main/tutorial).)"
msgstr ""
"下のフローチャートは資料を参照する順序を示す。各ノードから資料を開き、太い黒線に沿って進めるとよい。破線でつながるものは、演習に役立つ補足資料である。チュートリアルは[こちら](https://github.com/COSBlab/bAIes-"
"SM/tree/main/tutorial)にある。"

